C ELM10A              FIT CONSTRAINT INPUT QUANTITIES
C
C COC      PRESENT VALUE OF CONSTRAINED QUANTITY.  PRINTED AFTER FIT ELEMENT.
C DE0      DESIRED VALUE OF CONSTRAINED QUANTITY AS GIVEN ON FIT ELEMENT.
C SD       TOLERANCE.
C ACON     NUMERICAL CONSTANT IN ALGEBRAIC EXPRESSION
C COCO     INTERMEDIATE STEP FOR AGS MACHINE CONSTRAINT
C
      REAL            COC, DE0, SD, ACON, COCO
C
      COMMON /ELM10A/ COC, DE0, SD, ACON, COCO
